1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
Parse. A small companion. A shared care record.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:07,500
Her daily card. Her care companion.

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:11,000
A 3D-printed cardholder. One button to speak; the phone connects to Parse.

4
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:14,000
Mei: “My knee hurts after my morning walk.”

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,500
“Please share this with Jamie.”

6
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:23,300
Pendant → Phone → Parse → Care circle

7
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:27,000
First, Parse checks the note and sharing choice with Mei.

8
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:31,300
Parse reads back the note and the sharing choice.

9
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:33,600
Mei: “Yes, save that.”

10
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:35,500
Confirmed. Ready to sync.

11
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:39,800
After she confirms, the care note appears in Mei’s timeline.

12
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:45,000
No typing. No manual page refresh.

13
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:49,500
Jamie sees the updates Mei chooses to share.

14
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:53,950
Jamie’s caregiver account is already open.

15
00:00:53,950 --> 00:00:57,162
The shared note arrives without refreshing the page.

16
00:00:57,162 --> 00:01:00,000
Her own words and when it happened stay together.

17
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:04,954
Mei can ask Jamie for practical help.

18
00:01:04,954 --> 00:01:11,378
Jamie acknowledges the request. Mei knows it has been seen.

19
00:01:11,378 --> 00:01:13,500
After the call, Jamie records what they agreed.

20
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:17,500
Parse: “Mei, it’s time for your evening medication.”

21
00:01:17,500 --> 00:01:20,000
A reminder remains separate from a confirmed dose.

22
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:24,500
Checked medication instructions and schedules stay together.

23
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:27,870
Bring the relevant care history to the next appointment.

24
00:01:27,870 --> 00:01:32,694
Review the draft. Every item keeps its source.

25
00:01:32,694 --> 00:01:36,000
Share a read-only copy after your review.

26
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:39,000
Parse. Speak naturally. Keep care connected.

27
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:41,500
Working software + a simulated wearable concept. Physical hardware integration is the next step.
